      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--stage">What we watch for</p>
      <h2>Four areas, every day</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cards mt">
      <div class="card"><h3>Social and emotional skills</h3><p>Sharing, waiting, saying what you need, calming down.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Physical development</h3><p>Climbing, balancing, pouring, cutting, drawing. Every day, on the turf and in the sand.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Language and literacy</h3><p>Stories, songs and a lot of conversation in English. Phonics starts when a child is curious about letters, not before.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Mathematics and reasoning</h3><p>Counting real things, sorting, spotting shapes and patterns.</p></div>
